         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_rules",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>General rules</h3>The game has five levels. In each level, the table shows twenty Etruscan-Roman numbers arranged in five rows and four columns, with one numeral hidden per row. Your goal is to click the hidden cells to reveal the numerals. When you reveal all of them, you complete the level and can move on to the next one. In the last level, the numbers go from 81 to 99.</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_game",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Building like Etruscan-Romans</h3>Click the hidden cells to reveal the Etruscan-Roman numerals. To start a new exercise, click the <b>New exercise</b> button below the table.</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p style=\"text-align: center\"><span id=\"buildingEtrLevel\" class=\"level-badge\"></span></p><p><table id=\"buildingEtr\" class=\"tableTen tableTenBgBlue buildingTable\"><tr><th colspan=\"4\"><i>Etruscan-Roman numerals</i></th></tr></table></p><p style=\"text-align: center\"><button id=\"buildingEtrReset\" class=\"reset-tutor-btn\">🎲 New exercise</button></p><p id=\"buildingEtrCompleteMsg\" class=\"mngCongrats\" style=\"display: none; text-align: center\">🎉🎉🎉 CORRECT! 🎉🎉🎉<br />You revealed all the Etruscan-Roman numbers!<br />Great job!</p><p id=\"buildingEtrCongratsMsg\" class=\"mngCongrats\" style=\"display: none; text-align: center\">🎉🎉🎉 CONGRATULATIONS! 🎉🎉🎉<br />You completed all the levels!<br />Excellent work!</p><p style=\"text-align: center\"><button id=\"buildingEtrNextLevel\" class=\"game-next-btn\" style=\"display: none\"></button></p><span id=\"buildingEtrWordLevel\" style=\"display: none\">Level</span><span id=\"buildingEtrWordNextLevel\" style=\"display: none\">Next level</span><span id=\"buildingEtrWordPlayAgain\" style=\"display: none\">Play again</span>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\">The numerals follow the rules of the Etruscan-Roman numeral system presented in <i>Large Etruscan-Roman numbers</i> (<htcite0>).</p>",
